Article 12
Child victims of acts of violence, in addition to obtaining the rights as referred to in Article 11, also obtain the following special rights: a. the right to survival, growth, and development; b. the right to basic civil registration services;
c. the right to equal protection;
d. the right to be free from various stigma; and
e. the right to freedom.
