Considering: that to implement the provisions of number I letter H number 2 and number 6 column 5 of the appendix to Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government as has been amended several times, most recently by Law Number 11 of 2020 concerning the Job Creation Law, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning the Protection of Women and Children from Acts of Violence;

In View of:
